As I said, it was a gift.

67
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:43,577
He and I are good friends.

68
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,257
Let him go please.

69
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:49,777
A good friend

70
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:53,477
why don't you tell

71
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,277
me what your good friend's name is?

72
00:03:55,360 --> 00:04:01,537
Hmm what's the matter limey you want to
see what a New York pokey is like huh?

73
