Not from over there!

89
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:51,360
I'll blow your damn brains out!

90
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,680
Suddenly, his body started to
give off some sort of glow.

91
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:03,340
It was just incredible.

92
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,337
The soda cap blew off
and flew as fast as a

93
