bullet straight over to
snap the cop's finger.

94
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:18,520
Oh, I gave in to my temper again.

95
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,740
Crap, I'm in for it.

96
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:23,840
Oh, Granny Arena's going to be furious.

97
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:27,219
She beat down two cops but
is scared of his grandma?

98
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:28,580
I'll just explain.

99
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,958
Granny Arena will understand
if I explain, won't she?

100
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,420
All right, Mr.

101
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,560
Pickpocket, what say we
hightail it on out of here?

102
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:41,718
He didn't know exactly how he launched
the bottle cap with such force.

103
