109
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:05,453
Everyone calls me Smokey, and I'd sure
like it if you'd tell me your name.

110
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,460
It's Joestar.

111
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,680
Joseph Joestar.

112
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:20,480
My friends call me Jojo.

113
