117
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:39,299
And though it's faint, he
has body heat and a pulse.

118
00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:42,280
We are looking at a living man!

119
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:48,340
Straightzo, understand who he
is, how long he's been there,

120
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:52,280
how he got there in the first
place, what the masks are for.

121
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:54,100
None of that matters.

122
00:06:54,540 --> 00:06:56,740
We are here for one purpose only.

123
00:06:57,260 --> 00:06:59,980
I brought you because
of your hormone ability,

124
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:04,680
so you can use it to utterly destroy
him while he slumbers in this stone.

125
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,720
And Joseph Joestar? Huh? What?

126
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:11,940
Joseph Joestar, how is he doing?

127
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:16,060
I hear he has Hamon ability
and saved your life once.

128
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,960
Why bring up Jojo now?

129
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:23,440
As I recall, he was but 13
years of age at the time.

130
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:25,780
Yes, quite young.

131
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:30,496
Your plane was hijacked by criminals
who wanted to hold you for ransom.

132
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,190
Hey, kid!

133
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:39,237
You can't stay back here, you know!

134
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,320
Get up front!

135
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:47,977
You're hijacking the plane and
kidnapping Speedwagon, correct?

136
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:49,820
I am only a bystander.

137
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:51,116
This is his problem.

138
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:53,142
I'm just going to read my story.

139
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:55,947
Do your business and
just leave me out of it.

140
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:59,800
Wrong answer, punk! Now move! Jojo!

141
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,880
Not good.

142
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:11,182
That suit was a gift from Arena.

143
00:08:11,460 --> 00:08:13,017
This'll set him off for sure.

144
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:15,218
He's got no sense of self-restraint.

145
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:18,880
Control yourself, Jojo!

146
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,197
You fellows did know
there was the possibility

147
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:23,497
