150
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,480
What did that crazy kid do?

151
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,699
We're gonna crash!

152
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:39,940
Run the controls!

153
00:08:40,300 --> 00:08:41,520
