154
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:44,945
Here, get the pilot ready,
we're going to jump!

155
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:55,060
Why can't you ever just
think things through, Jojo?

156
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,400
I do, in fact.

157
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,700
A great deal.

158
00:08:58,420 --> 00:09:01,780
Mostly about how to best keep
you and Granny Iran safe.

159
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:06,740
You two are the only family that I've got.

160
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:12,200
He may have his grandfather's face,
but he's far from being a gentleman.

161
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:19,500
That was the day I discovered that
Joseph was able to use Hamon. So,

162
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:24,657
